#!sketch
# an entity-component system: trees for entities, flows for systems

--- arena ---

# the player: components it has, bullets it spawns
[Ship]
    \-& {Transform}
    \-& {Health}
    \-*-> [Bullet]   # one per shot
        \-& {Transform}
        \-& {Damage}
[Asteroid]
    \-& {Transform}
    \-{shattered}-? [Shard]   # only after a hit

--- systems ---

# systems query components by kind
[Physics] -> {Transform}
[Homing]  -> [Bullet]/{Transform}   # bullets only
{Damage}  -> [Combat] -> {Health}
[Combat]  ~> <Destroyed> -> [Spawner]
[Spawner] => [Shard]
